  "body": "## What changed\n\nEach of the 12 catalog cases now has `case.toml` with `kinds`, `machine` and `expect`.\nThe catalog tool reads canonical kind names from `KindInfo::ALL`.\nIt generates Example cases blocks under all 44 kind headings on the seven operation pages.\nThe first-part case appears under Face, 2D Pocket and Drill.\n`--check` rejects missing metadata, unknown kinds, stale lists and links to unknown cases before the CLI build.\nFiltered commands still validate links across the whole catalog.\nThe generator preserves guide prose and refuses malformed blocks before writing.\nThe catalog README documents the supported flat TOML format.\nThe decision record explains the schema and generation choices.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: medium. No escalation.\nBase: upstream/main at 7d1f1d72c.\n\n## Cause\n\nCatalog checks covered case layout and NC parity.\nThey did not read case metadata or check operation-page links.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe four original pins failed on unchanged code and pass with the fix:\n\n- `catalog_check_rejects_missing_case_metadata`\n- `catalog_check_rejects_unknown_case_kind`\n- `catalog_check_rejects_missing_case_link`\n- `catalog_check_rejects_dangling_case_link`\n\nAdditional pins cover generation and metadata:\n\n- `catalog_links_generate_idempotently_and_check_without_touching_prose`\n- `catalog_metadata_rejects_missing_duplicate_and_empty_fields`\n- `catalog_metadata_rejects_invalid_syntax_by_name`\n- `catalog_metadata_accepts_multiline_arrays_comments_and_literal_strings`\n- `catalog_seed_links_face_pocket_and_drill`\n- `misplaced_example_markers_refuse`\n- `unclosed_example_blocks_refuse`\n- `nested_markers_and_headings_inside_example_blocks_refuse`\n- `a_case_kind_without_a_guide_heading_refuses_before_writing`\n\nReplacing catalog.rs with the exact upstream version makes all four original pins fail.\nRestoring the fix makes them pass.\nEach metadata guard was also disabled and restored: required fields, duplicate fields, duplicate kinds, empty values, assignment newlines and unknown fields.\nEach mutation failed its pin and passed after restoration.\nThe same red/green check covers misplaced markers, nested markers or headings, unclosed blocks and missing guide headings.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed both steps.\nThe app example_catalog suite passed 33 tests and ignored two.\nXtask passed 241 unit tests and 29 integration tests.\n`cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe self-review justified all 65 hunks.\n`git diff --check upstream/main` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full valid-input catalog CLI rebuild/check commands were not run.\nThe gate exercised the existing catalog regression suite and the new metadata/link paths.\nScreenshot generation, PDFs, the GUI and machine cuts were not exercised.\nThe two ignored app catalog tests were not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n#3103 touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nIt changes Bore strategy prose in operations-2d.md.\nThis change adds a generated block below the heading, before the unchanged icon and prose.\nThe full list of 51 open PRs showed no other overlap with changed files.\n\nChangelog: Catalog cases declare metadata and operation guides show checked Example cases lists.\n\nFixes #2855\n",
